{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Falling Stars</strong></i> is a <strong>simulation</strong> game where players design the <strong>automatic defense system</strong> of a city to protect it from falling celestial objects. It's a mix between a <strong>tower defense</strong> and an <strong>automation</strong> game with <strong>physics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902430/extras/4135f6e1368396827399b3c43aa14be0.avif?t=1769007824\" width=800 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902430/extras/5ff9b494cce4585e905c07c74cb73b25.poster.avif?t=1769007824\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902430/extras/5ff9b494cce4585e905c07c74cb73b25.webm?t=1769007824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902430/extras/5ff9b494cce4585e905c07c74cb73b25.mp4?t=1769007824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play on various unique worlds!</strong> You are called to protect a cast of planets with <strong>unique atmospheres</strong> and <strong>new technologies</strong> developed by their quirky <strong>robo-citizens</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> new types of celestial objects with different <strong>strengths and weaknesses</strong>. Frozen meteors will thaw with fire, metal asteroids will transmit lightning, and much more. Each new level will bring new <strong>challenges</strong>, and the <strong>designs</strong> to pass them will need to be more <strong>complex</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902430/extras/8c5897e6e4ef3567c0ac99df0c2b994b.avif?t=1769007824\" width=800 height=128 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902430/extras/a1f586bfe90fcd221966fd54669fb67e.poster.avif?t=1769007824\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902430/extras/a1f586bfe90fcd221966fd54669fb67e.webm?t=1769007824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902430/extras/a1f586bfe90fcd221966fd54669fb67e.mp4?t=1769007824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything is a physical\u00a0object,\u00a0and you can exploit that!</strong> Each level can be solved in <strong>infinite ways</strong>, and they will test your <strong>creativity</strong>. You can create an <strong>efficient</strong> and clean solution, or a <strong>messy</strong> and overengineered one. The sky is the limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you think you've found your <strong>ideal design</strong>, sit back and watch the <strong>chaos</strong> produced by the objects <strong>falling</strong>, <strong>bouncing</strong>, and <strong>exploding</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902430/extras/f5f7204439e1279a24835db5bd4417cf.avif?t=1769007824\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902430/extras/75b01519180755083f6a9cff8a54e5d5.poster.avif?t=1769007824\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902430/extras/75b01519180755083f6a9cff8a54e5d5.webm?t=1769007824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902430/extras/75b01519180755083f6a9cff8a54e5d5.mp4?t=1769007824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you think you can find a more efficient solution?</strong> Do not fret. You can <strong>iterate</strong> between different designs really <strong>fast</strong>. You can add, destroy, or move your defense buildings endlessly and <strong>without cost</strong>. And if your head is not on the game at the moment, your solution will be <strong>saved</strong>, so you can always <strong>come back later</strong> and tinker with it again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902430/extras/e865c0b2e8b02ebc3f19d62115eeb444.avif?t=1769007824\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902430/extras/923719ced76c5335fd3f80587d5cd7e5.poster.avif?t=1769007824\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902430/extras/923719ced76c5335fd3f80587d5cd7e5.webm?t=1769007824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902430/extras/923719ced76c5335fd3f80587d5cd7e5.mp4?t=1769007824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your own levels using the in-game level editor!</strong>  Build whatever crazy idea you have in mind and <strong>share</strong> it on <strong>Steam Workshop.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Your first mission was completed, Commander!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2902430/9ef4ef88370cf2810ba8827e05470e0427cf93b2.jpg"},{"name":"Starry night at the dessert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2902430/7b2697427210ef2b542f68531491a511205ee594.jpg"},{"name":"Decorations at the dessert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2902430/d8a8887898b138472a7fbc8ecbd53b4863db5039.jpg"},{"name":"This second mission was a bit chilly, Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2902430/79f15454cc3cbd56da1e63594ea656d6b8331287.jpg"},{"name":"Starry night at the tundra","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2902430/a7c19ca0e9c04a16d415f2a003cfbd29094f7908.jpg"},{"name":"Decorations at the tundra","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2902430/890d04946b3a8117bf1d45b9ba7771a53eeeaa4c.jpg"},{"name":"Your victory was explosive, Commander!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2902430/f006feea0fb63a14fb416454fe59d6b2ab22c2cd.jpg"},{"name":"Starry night at the volcano","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2902430/82c114f0ca164145a147bddff485c1762f7fc79a.jpg"},{"name":"Decorations at the volcano","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2902430/78d3f7748ad68e6bc8271ae60c081f81cb9bc079.jpg"},{"name":"Your charisma is magnetic, Commander!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2902430/f32ca31889aec55084eb9879efc7503829b2f9a9.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2902430?t=1769007824","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea